  "repo_truth": "The complete 34-entry P1A subject changed from sha256:04c6eeac4365a472f5783aeb8dde01a93ea7db327f30163210a4f823c038a9e0 to sha256:1bdb1bd3a912f590ab9af31586afbca4acb538235e26146ddd7a17efecdd8ad9. The causal delta rejects repository_path rebinding of every package-owned intake exact ref while preserving custom repository intakes, and corrects the P1A proof to the exact profile/vector fingerprint. Current raw results: hcm_2_4_definition_runtime 7 passed; hcm_2_4_definition_support 13 passed; unchanged hcm_2_3_registration_kernel 16 passed; complete named wall 244 passed; cargo fmt check and git diff check exit 0; frozen HCM-2.3 test SHA-256 is 86e6e98fe8fad63578be3d157d3a836c4bfe3a4dc7aa49f1ff41d87e33b61629; GitNexus detect-changes reports LOW with zero affected processes.",
